    <body><h1>全局Header参数</h1><div style="margin-left:20px;"><table><thead><tr><th>参数名</th><th>值</th><th>是否启用</th><th>备注</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>authorization</td><td>{{token}}</td><td>否</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h1>2、Auth</h1><div style="margin-left:0px;"><h2>2.1、Login with account/phone and password</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Authenticate a user with an account name, email, or phone number plus a password. Returns a JWT access token and the authenticated user summary.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/auth/login</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>post</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求参数示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "login": "test1",
    "password": "111111"
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>json字段说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">字段名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">必选</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">login</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Account name, email, or phone number.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">password</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>User password.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": true,
    "data": {
        "access_token": "eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJodHRwOi8vNDkuMjM1LjUzLjUzOjkwMDEvYXBpL3YxL3VzZXItY2VudGVyL2F1dGgvbG9naW4iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODkzNjY4NTQsImV4cCI6MTc5MTk1ODg1NCwibmJmIjoxNzg5MzY2ODU0LCJqdGkiOiI3ZnpncGRmdzNPZnYzbkh4Iiwic3ViIjoiMSIsInBydiI6IjIzYmQ1Yzg5NDlmNjAwYWRiMzllNzAxYzQwMDg3MmRiN2E1OTc2ZjcifQ.04EH1_QOwVRxVM_d2LhgN777HDkflr1WIAXmJ5lw4hA",
        "token_type": "bearer",
        "expires_in": 2592000,
        "user": {
            "id": 1,
            "name": "superadmin",
            "email": "superadmin@example.com",
            "phone": "13811974106",
            "status": "active",
            "roles": [
                "super_admin"
            ],
            "permissions": [
                "system:user:list",
                "system:role:list",
                "system:menu:list",
                "system:user:query",
                "system:user:create",
                "system:user:update",
                "system:user:delete",
                "system:user:update-password",
                "system:role:query",
                "system:role:create",
                "system:role:update",
                "system:role:delete",
                "system:permission:assign-role-menu",
                "system:permission:assign-role-data-scope",
                "system:permission:assign-user-role",
                "system:menu:query",
                "system:menu:create",
                "system:menu:update",
                "system:menu:delete"
            ]
        }
    },
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "message": "Invalid credentials",
    "errors": {
        "credentials": [
            "Invalid credentials"
        ]
    },
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>2.2、Login with phone and SMS verification code</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Authenticate a user with a mainland-China phone number and a 6-digit SMS verification code. If no user exists for the phone, one is created automatically. Returns a JWT access token and the authenticated user summary.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/auth/login-phone</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>post</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求参数示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "phone": "string",
    "code": "string"
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>json字段说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">字段名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">必选</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">phone</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Mainland China phone number (11 digits).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">code</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>6-digit SMS verification code.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>[]
</code></pre></table></div><h2>2.3、Register a new user</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Register a new user. At least one identifier (email or phone) is expected; the <code>user</code> role is assigned by default. Returns a JWT access token and the authenticated user summary.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/auth/register</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>post</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求参数示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "name": "string",
    "email": "string",
    "phone": "string",
    "password": "string",
    "password_confirmation": "string"
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>json字段说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">字段名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">必选</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">name</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Display name (auto-generated if omitted).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">email</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Email (must be unique if provided).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">phone</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Mainland China phone number (must be unique if provided).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">password</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Password.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">password_confirmation</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Must match <code>password</code>.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>[]
</code></pre></table></div><h2>2.4、Get the authenticated user</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Returns the full authenticated user model (with roles and permissions loaded).</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/auth/me</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>get</li>
</ul>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": true,
    "data": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "superadmin",
        "nickname": null,
        "email": "superadmin@example.com",
        "phone": "13811974106",
        "email_verified_at": null,
        "phone_verified_at": "2026-09-09T07:22:04.000000Z",
        "status": "active",
        "avatar": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T07:22:04.000000Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-09-09T07:22:04.000000Z"
    },
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "message": "Unauthenticated.",
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>2.5、Get permission info for the logged-in user</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Returns the authenticated user's basic profile, role codes, permission identifiers, and menu tree (filtered by the menus assigned to their roles). Used by the ruoyi-vue-pro frontend to build the admin sidebar and guard buttons.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/auth/permission-info</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>get</li>
</ul>
