<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "message": "Unauthenticated.",
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>2.6、Logout</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Invalidates the current JWT token (blacklists it).</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/auth/logout</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>post</li>
</ul>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Successfully logged out",
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>成功返回示例的参数说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">参数名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">success</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">boolean</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">message</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">string</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">code</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">integer</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "message": "Unauthenticated.",
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>2.7、Refresh token</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Blacklists the current token and issues a new JWT. The new token must be used for subsequent requests.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/auth/refresh</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>post</li>
</ul>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": true,
    "data": {
        "access_token": "eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJodHRwOi8vNDkuMjM1LjUzLjUzOjkwMDEvYXBpL3YxL3VzZXItY2VudGVyL2F1dGgvcmVmcmVzaCIsImlhdCI6MTc4OTM2Njg1NCwiZXhwIjoxNzkyMDI4NTkwLCJuYmYiOjE3ODk0MzY1OTAsImp0aSI6Ikc5VzVWOE5wc1F1Q21RNnEiLCJzdWIiOiIxIiwicHJ2IjoiMjNiZDVjODk0OWY2MDBhZGIzOWU3MDFjNDAwODcyZGI3YTU5NzZmNyJ9.hc8CuR3wZCa0hGeL62JRp1Dw_dpnKpxY00kBsXTqfAs",
        "token_type": "bearer",
        "expires_in": 2592000,
        "user": {
            "id": 1,
            "name": "superadmin",
            "email": "superadmin@example.com",
            "phone": "13811974106",
            "status": "active",
            "roles": [
                "super_admin"
            ],
            "permissions": [
                "system:user:list",
                "system:role:list",
                "system:menu:list",
                "system:user:query",
                "system:user:create",
                "system:user:update",
                "system:user:delete",
                "system:user:update-password",
                "system:role:query",
                "system:role:create",
                "system:role:update",
                "system:role:delete",
                "system:permission:assign-role-menu",
                "system:permission:assign-role-data-scope",
                "system:permission:assign-user-role",
                "system:menu:query",
                "system:menu:create",
                "system:menu:update",
                "system:menu:delete"
            ]
        }
    },
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "message": "Unauthenticated.",
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div></div><h1>3、User</h1><div style="margin-left:0px;"><h2>3.1、Get current user profile</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Returns the authenticated user's own profile (full User model).</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/users/profile</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>get</li>
</ul>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": true,
    "data": {
        "id": 1,
        "name": "superadmin",
        "nickname": null,
        "email": "superadmin@example.com",
        "phone": "13811974106",
        "email_verified_at": null,
        "phone_verified_at": "2026-09-09T07:22:04.000000Z",
        "status": "active",
        "avatar": null,
        "created_at": "2026-09-09T07:22:04.000000Z",
        "updated_at": "2026-09-09T07:22:04.000000Z"
    },
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>3.2、Update current user profile</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Updates the authenticated user's own profile fields (name, nickname, avatar). Password and roles cannot be changed here.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/users/profile</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>put</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求参数示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "name": "",
    "nickname": "hh",
    "avatar": "string"
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>json字段说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">字段名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">必选</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">name</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">nickname</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">avatar</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
