<td></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div><h2>3.4、List users (paginated)</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Returns a paginated list of users with roles and permissions loaded. Requires the <code>manage-users</code> permission.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/users</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>get</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求Query参数</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
