        "created_at": "2026-09-22T09:39:20.000000Z",
        "id": 404
    },
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "message": "The selected status is invalid. (and 1 more error)",
    "errors": {
        "status": [
            "The selected status is invalid."
        ],
        "roles.0": [
            "The roles.0 field must be a string."
        ]
    },
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>3.6、Get user details</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Returns a single user with roles and permissions loaded. Requires the <code>manage-users</code> permission.</li>
</ul>
