    "message": "User not found",
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>3.7、Update user</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Updates an existing user. All fields are optional (partial update). Requires the <code>manage-users</code> permission.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/users/{{id}}</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>put</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求参数示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "name": "test",
    "email": "b@b.com",
    "phone": "13811974011",
    "password": "123456",
    "status": "active",
    "nickname": "string",
    "avatar": "string",
    "roles": [
        "admin"
    ]
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>json字段说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">字段名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">必选</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">name</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">email</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Must be unique (excluding this user).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">phone</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Must be unique (excluding this user).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">password</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>New password (optional).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">status</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>User account status.</td>
