<ul>
<li>Creates a new menu, menu item, or button. Requires the <code>system:menu:create</code> permission.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/menus</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>post</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求参数示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "name": "用户管理1",
    "permission": "system:user:list",
    "type": 2,
    "sort": 1,
    "parent_id": 1,
    "path": "user",
    "icon": "ep:avatar",
    "component": "system\/user\/index",
    "component_name": "SystemUser",
    "status": 0,
    "visible": true,
    "keep_alive": true,
    "always_show": true
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>json字段说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">字段名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">必选</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">name</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Menu display name.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">permission</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Permission identifier (e.g. <code>system:user:query</code>).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">type</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>Menu type (1 = Directory, 2 = Menu, 3 = Button).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">sort</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>Display sort order.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">parent_id</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>Parent menu id; 0 for root.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">path</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Route path.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">icon</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Icon identifier.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">component</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Frontend component path.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">component_name</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>Frontend component name.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">status</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>Common enable/disable status (0 = enabled, 1 = disabled).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">visible</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>boolean</td>
<td>Whether the menu is visible.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">keep_alive</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>boolean</td>
<td>Whether to keep the component alive.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">always_show</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>boolean</td>
<td>Always show the root menu even with one child.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": true,
    "data": 3041,
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "message": "The parent id field is required.",
    "errors": {
        "parent_id": [
            "The parent id field is required."
        ]
    },
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>4.3、Simple menu list</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
