<ul>
<li>Returns a paginated role list. Requires the <code>system:role:query</code> permission.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/roles</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>get</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求Query参数</h5>
