    "success": true,
    "data": 136,
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": false,
    "message": "Role code already exists",
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>5.3、Simple role list</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
