<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">success</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">boolean</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">code</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">integer</td>
<td>Business code (0 = success).</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table></div><h2>6.3、Assign data scope to a role</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Sets the data-scope (data-level permission) for a role, optionally with a custom set of department ids. Requires the <code>system:permission:assign-role-data-scope</code> permission.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/permissions/assign-role-data-scope</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>post</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求参数示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "role_id": "4",
    "data_scope": "2",
    "data_scope_dept_ids": [
        1,
        2
    ]
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>json字段说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">字段名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">必选</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">role_id</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>Role id.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">data_scope</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>Data scope (1 = All, 2 = DeptCustom, 3 = DeptOnly, 4 = DeptAndChild, 5 = Self).</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">data_scope_dept_ids</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>array</td>
<td>Custom department ids. Required only when <code>data_scope</code> is <code>2</code> (DeptCustom).</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": true,
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>成功返回示例的参数说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">参数名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">success</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">boolean</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">code</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">integer</td>
<td>Business code (0 = success).</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": false,
    "message": "Built-in system roles cannot be modified or deleted",
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>6.4、Get role ids assigned to a user</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Returns the list of role ids assigned to the given user. Requires the <code>system:permission:assign-user-role</code> permission.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/permissions/user-roles</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>get</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求Query参数</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">参数名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">示例值</th>
<th>必选</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">userId</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">4</td>
<td>是</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>User id.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": true,
    "data": [
        1,
        2
    ],
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table></div><h2>6.5、Assign roles to a user</h2><div style="margin-left:20px;"><h5>简要描述</h5>
<ul>
<li>Replaces the set of roles assigned to a user (full sync — omitted/empty <code>role_ids</code> clears the assignment). Requires the <code>system:permission:assign-user-role</code> permission.</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求URL</h5>
<ul>
<li><code>{{host}}/api/v1/user-center/permissions/assign-user-role</code> </li>
</ul>
<h5>请求方式</h5>
<ul>
<li>post</li>
</ul>
<h5>请求参数示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "user_id": "40",
    "role_ids": [
        1,
        2
    ]
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>json字段说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">字段名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">必选</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">user_id</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">是</td>
<td>integer</td>
<td>User id.</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">role_ids</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">否</td>
<td>array</td>
<td>Role ids to assign (full sync). Omit or send empty to clear.</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>成功返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": true,
    "code": 0
}
</code></pre></table>
<h5>成功返回示例的参数说明</h5>
<table>
<thead><tr style='background-color: rgb(0, 136, 204); color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>
<th style="text-align: left;">参数名</th>
<th style="text-align: left;">类型</th>
<th>说明</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">success</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">boolean</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="text-align: left;">code</td>
<td style="text-align: left;">integer</td>
<td>Business code (0 = success).</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h5>失败返回示例</h5>
<table width='100%' class='codestyle'><pre><code>{
    "success": false,
    "message": "User does not exist",
    "code": 1
}
</code></pre></table></div></div></body></html>